+  // Not-yet-loaded chunks are normally only retried when the bot crosses a
+  // chunk boundary (see updatePosition). A bot that sits still near where a
+  // viewer connects can end up with chunks that were missing from bot.world
+  // at that exact moment (e.g. a timing race right after spawn) and never
+  // get retried. This re-requests anything still missing on a timer.
+  retryMissingChunks () {
